WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.700
[Soft instrumental music]
Weather: A fresh outlook.

00:03.700 --> 00:10.700
Before: the original weather app
on desktop and mobile.

00:10.700 --> 00:15.200
After: paper tones, illustrated landscapes,
and a redesigned desktop and mobile layout.

00:15.200 --> 00:26.200
Recent places and current conditions:
feels like, wind, rainfall, humidity, and pressure.

00:26.200 --> 00:33.400
Search for London, choose an autocomplete result,
and open its forecast.

00:33.400 --> 00:46.900
Scroll through hourly conditions and select forecast days.
Highs, lows, rain chance, wind, sun times, UV, and air quality.

00:46.900 --> 00:52.200
Explore global cities and open Tokyo's nighttime forecast.

00:52.200 --> 01:03.700
Settings: change temperature, distance, and rainfall units.
Choose Romanian from eight available languages.

01:03.700 --> 01:17.700
On mobile: browse places, scroll through the hourly forecast,
and change language and temperature settings.

01:17.700 --> 01:24.000
A demonstration wind advisory appears alongside the forecast.

01:24.000 --> 01:32.300
Eleven illustrated weather states and nighttime artwork:
clear, cloudy, overcast, fog, haze, drizzle, rain, storm, snow, blizzard, and ice.

01:32.300 --> 01:37.500
Weather, close to home. Created by Ranzascu Radu.
[Instrumental music fades out]
